{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/AstronomyKit\/documentation\/AstronomyKit\/MoonPhases"},"kind":"article","seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Moon","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AstronomyKit\/documentation\/AstronomyKit\/Moon","doc:\/\/AstronomyKit\/documentation\/AstronomyKit\/MoonPhase","doc:\/\/AstronomyKit\/documentation\/AstronomyKit\/MoonQuarter","doc:\/\/AstronomyKit\/documentation\/AstronomyKit\/Libration","doc:\/\/AstronomyKit\/documentation\/AstronomyKit\/LunarNode","doc:\/\/AstronomyKit\/documentation\/AstronomyKit\/NodeKind"],"title":"Moon"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AstronomyKit\/documentation\/AstronomyKit\/Moon","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" type covers phase angles, illumination, quarter searches, position and velocity, libration, and node crossings."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Phase-Angle","text":"Phase Angle","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The phase angle indicates the Moon’s position in its cycle:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let angle = try Moon.phaseAngle(at: .now)","print(\"Phase angle: \\(angle)°\")","\/\/ 0° = New Moon, 90° = First Quarter, 180° = Full, 270° = Third Quarter"],"type":"codeListing"},{"anchor":"Phase-Names-and-Emoji","text":"Phase Names and Emoji","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Convert angles to human-readable descriptions:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let angle = try Moon.phaseAngle(at: .now)","","print(Moon.phaseName(for: angle))  \/\/ \"Waxing Gibbous\"","print(Moon.emoji(for: angle))      \/\/ \"🌔\""],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The eight phase names:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"New Moon (🌑)"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Waxing Crescent (🌒)"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"First Quarter (🌓)"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Waxing Gibbous (🌔)"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Full Moon (🌕)"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Waning Gibbous (🌖)"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Third Quarter (🌗)"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Waning Crescent (🌘)"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"anchor":"Illumination","text":"Illumination","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Calculate the fraction of the Moon that’s lit:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let angle = try Moon.phaseAngle(at: .now)","let illumination = Moon.illumination(for: angle)","print(\"Moon is \\(Int(illumination * 100))% illuminated\")"],"type":"codeListing"},{"anchor":"Finding-Quarter-Phases","text":"Finding Quarter Phases","type":"heading","level":2},{"anchor":"Search-for-a-Specific-Phase","text":"Search for a Specific Phase","type":"heading","level":3},{"syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/ Next full moon (nil if none occurs within the search window)","if let fullMoon = try Moon.searchPhase(.full, after: .now) {","    print(\"Next full moon: \\(fullMoon)\")","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"anchor":"Get-the-Next-Quarter","text":"Get the Next Quarter","type":"heading","level":3},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let quarter = try Moon.searchQuarter(after: .now)","print(\"\\(quarter.phase.emoji) \\(quarter.phase.name) at \\(quarter.time)\")"],"type":"codeListing"},{"anchor":"All-Quarters-in-a-Date-Range","text":"All Quarters in a Date Range","type":"heading","level":3},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let start = AstroTime(year: 2025, month: 1, 