is.kind.lunarName) at \\(apsis.time)\")","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"anchor":"Moonrise-and-Moonset","text":"Moonrise and Moonset","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use the "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AstronomyKit\/documentation\/AstronomyKit\/CelestialBody","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" interface:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let observer = Observer(latitude: 40.7, longitude: -74.0)","","if let moonrise = try CelestialBody.moon.riseTime(after: .now, from: observer) {","    print(\"Moonrise: \\(moonrise)\")","}","","if let moonset = try CelestialBody.moon.setTime(after: .now, from: observer) {","    print(\"Moonset: \\(moonset)\")","}"],"type":"codeListing"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Calculate moon phases, quarters, libration, and lunar nodes.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/astronomykit\/moonphases"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AstronomyKit\/documentation\/AstronomyKit"]]},"metadata":{"title":"Moon Phases","role":"article","modules":[{"name":"AstronomyKit"}],"roleHeading":"Article"},"references":{"doc://AstronomyKit/documentation/AstronomyKit/MoonPhase":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/AstronomyKit\/documentation\/AstronomyKit\/MoonPhase","kind":"symbol","title":"MoonPhase","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A phase of the Moon."}],"fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MoonPhase","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MoonPhase","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/astronomykit\/moonphase"},"doc://AstronomyKit/documentation/AstronomyKit/Libration":{"url":"\/documentation\/astronomykit\/libration","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Libration"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":